---
layout: layouts/base.webc
title: "Posts"
description: "Long-form notes on the projects Ming Liang is building, experiments in progress, and the lessons picked up along the way."
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 motion-rise">
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 text-base-content/65">
      <span class="text-primary">$</span>
      <span class="text-sm">ls ~/posts</span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm font-light text-base-content/70 max-w-lg motion-fade motion-delay-1">
      Long-form notes on the projects I am building, experiments I am trying,
      and the lessons picked up along the way.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col motion-rise motion-delay-1">
    <div webc:for="post of collections.posts.toReversed()" class="group border-b border-base-content/8">
      <a
        :href="post.url"
        class="group grid grid-cols-[5.5rem_1fr] sm:grid-cols-[7rem_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-4 no-underline hover:no-underline"
      >
        <time
          class="text-xs text-base-content/65 shrink-0"
          @text="post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-SG', { day: '2-digit', month: 'short', year: 'numeric' })"
        ></time>
        <h2
          class="text-sm sm:text-base text-base-content group-hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-150"
          @text="post.data.title"
        ></h2>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline text-primary/35 group-hover:text-primary/75 transition-colors duration-150 text-xs">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
